        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Electricity, lignite, at power plant
The average allocated net electrical efficiency is about 33.7 %. The electricity generation of this technology in the region is at about 260 TWh based on Eurostat/IEA. NA; UUID: cf530ea3-cbf7-3254-91e3-af565005c2cd
Electricity output at busbar. The dataset uses the average net efficiency of power plants in the region adjusted for co-generation (using allocation based on exergy content). 
Location: ENTSO-E in 2019
Technology: Average installed technology.
Time period: 
Production volume: 260 TWh
Sampling: Databases/ literature data based on regional statistics.
Extrapolations: No relevant extrapolations.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_cf530ea3-cbf7-3254-91e3-af565005c2cd.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
